  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your everyday wardrobe with Rothco's Solid Color 100% Cotton T-Shirt. Built for comfort and durability, the military-styled short sleeve shirt is ideal as a base layer or standalone crewneck tee, featuring breathable fabric that wicks moisture, reinforced seams for long-lasting wear, and a tag-less design for itch-free movement. With a standard fit and rugged feel, these cotton uniform shirts deliver a clean look that works on the job, off duty, or wherever the day takes you.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "21161",
  "description": "<p>Elevate your everyday wardrobe with Rothco's Solid Color 100% Cotton T-Shirt. Built for comfort and durability, the military-styled short sleeve shirt is ideal as a base layer or standalone crewneck tee, featuring breathable fabric that wicks moisture, reinforced seams for long-lasting wear, and a tag-less design for itch-free movement. With a standard fit and rugged feel, these cotton uniform shirts deliver a clean look that works on the job, off duty, or wherever the day takes you. Essential Base Layer: Our cotton t-shirts are designed to deliver all-day comfort whether you&rsquo;re wearing them alone or under your uniform or outfit as a base layer undershirt, while providing a casual, yet professional appearance. Breathable &amp; Long-Lasting: This 100% cotton t-shirt is built to handle daily wear and tough conditions without sacrificing comfort. The soft, breathable fabric naturally wicks moisture away from your skin to keep you cool and dry all day long. Action Ready: These military crewneck tees consist of reinforced seams at the collar, sleeves, and bottom hem to further enhance the shirt&rsquo;s durability. With a tag-less neck label, you&rsquo;re free to move around without any itches or scratches. Standard Fit: These rugged uniform t-shirts are standard fit, giving you room and flexibility for various activities, especially around the arms. Our t-shirts sit approximately at the waist for full coverage. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Pair your short sleeve tee with one of our Tactical BDU Cargo Pants or Vintage Paratrooper Cargo Shorts.</p>",
